settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Create PEP Action
  
  Creates a new PEP Action record with optional nested PEP and EHCP records.
  
  ## Request Structure
  
  ### PEP Actions Fields (Parent - Single Record)
  - `have_pep_actions_implemented_at_home` - yes/no
  - `pep_action` - Text description
  - `pep_staff_responsible[]` - Array of staff IDs
  - `pep_review_date` - Date format YYYY-MM-DD
  
  ### PEP Records (Child - Multiple via "Add More" button)
  - `pep_records[0][latest_pep_meeting_completed]` - yes/no
  - `pep_records[0][pep_date]` - Date
  - `pep_records[0][pep_attendees]` - Text
  - `pep_records[0][pep_summary]` - Long text
  - `pep_records[0][pep_targets]` - Text
  - `pep_records[0][pep_document]` - File upload
  
  Add more PEP records with `pep_records[1][...]`, `pep_records[2][...]`, etc.
  
  ### EHCP Records (Child - Multiple via "Add More" button)
  - `ehcp_records[0][does_yp_have_ehcp]` - yes/no
  - `ehcp_records[0][ehcp_areas_of_need]` - Text
  - `ehcp_records[0][ehcp_current_outcomes]` - Text
  - `ehcp_records[0][ehcp_responsibilities]` - Text
  - `ehcp_records[0][ehcp_attachment]` - File upload
  - `ehcp_records[0][are_new_amendments_requested]` - yes/no
  - `ehcp_records[0][ehcp_reason]` - Text
  - `ehcp_records[0][ehcp_evidence]` - File upload
  
  Add more EHCP records with `ehcp_records[1][...]`, `ehcp_records[2][...]`, etc.
  
  ## Notes
  
  - All fields are optional (prefixed with ~)
  - Files must be uploaded using multipart/form-data
  - The parent PEP Action is created first, then child records are linked to it
}
